Optional boot ROM image (-DDREAM_NO_BIOS_IMAGE): with the HLE BIOS nothing loads a ROM image,
so the 2 MB zero-filled buffer is not allocated; area-0 ROM reads give zero (as the empty
buffer did) and writes are dropped. The PSP build uses the 2 MB for the texture cache.
Effect on PC: none unless the macro is defined.

